Subject: [PATCH] Retain bounded sequential Copilot rail operations

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 src/copilot_cmd.cpp           | 23 ++++++++++
 src/copilot_cmd.h             | 12 +++---
 src/network/network_admin.cpp | 81 ++++++++++++++++++++---------------
 src/network/network_admin.h   |  3 +-
 src/saveload/copilot_sl.cpp   | 48 ++++++++++++++++++---
